id=tailscale_root
name=Tailscale Root
version=v0.4.1
versionCode=5
author=Lxns
description=Standalone root tailscaled with bundled or self-built binaries (offline install, arm64) and WebUI (status / peers / latency chart / updater / logs), plus one-tap Action toggle. Auto hostname from device name, optional HTTP-proxy egress (auto-detects Box for Root), src_valid_mark guard keeps tproxy modules working alongside WireGuard. Config: /data/adb/tailscale/env
